<!-- pages/home/home.wxml —— 首页：适老化极简卡片式设计 -->
<view class="home-container {{fontClass}}">
  <!-- 顶部主卡片：开始学习 -->
  <view class="card learn-card">
    <view class="card-title">开始学习</view>
    <!-- 具象太阳图标大徽章 -->
    <view class="badge-wrapper">
      <view class="sun-badge">
        <image class="sun-icon" src="/assets/img/icon-sun.svg" mode="aspectFit" />
      </view>
    </view>
    <!-- 问候与引导正文 -->
    <view class="welcome-section">
      <text class="lead-char">亲</text>
      <text class="lead-text">
        爱的长辈，欢迎来到课堂。五个字一组，学完一组接着下一组，都是与生活息息相关的常用汉字。保持每天阅读的好习惯，让生活更加丰富多彩。
      </text>
    </view>
    <!-- 主按钮：进入课堂 -->
    <view class="cta-btn" hover-class="cta-btn-hover" bindtap="onStart">
      <text class="cta-btn-text">开始学习</text>
      <text class="cta-btn-arrow">→</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <!-- 底部卡片：识字成果报告 -->
  <view class="card report-card" hover-class="card-hover" bindtap="goProgress">
    <view class="report-header">
      <image class="report-icon" src="/assets/img/icon-report.svg" mode="aspectFit" />
      <text class="report-title">识字成果报告</text>
    </view>
    <view class="report-metrics">
      <view class="metric-item">
        <view class="metric-label">累计识字</view>
        <view class="metric-val-wrap">
          <text class="metric-num">{{learnedCount}}</text>
          <text class="metric-unit">字</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="metric-item">
        <view class="metric-label">连续学习</view>
        <view class="metric-val-wrap">
          <text class="metric-num">{{streak}}</text>
          <text class="metric-unit">天</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>